official_text:
Approval by the Board of Education of a Professional Services Contract between the District and Eide Bailly, LLP, as the District’s Auditor, Palo Alto, CA, for the term January 1, 2020 through December 31. 2020, providing the following services, more fully described in Exhibit “A”, incorporated herein by reference as though fully set forth, for the compensation stated:
 FY19-20 District Annual Audit: $177,000.00;
 FY19-20 Measure G, Financial and Performance Audit: $7,000.00;
 FY19-20 Measure G1, Financial and Performance Audit: $11,000.00; and
 FY19-20 Measure B & J, Financial and Performance Audit: $150,000.00
at a cumulative cost under this Agreement not to exceed $345,000.00.
